*lost** 1.5 times the amount he won in the second race:\n\n$$\n\\text{Third race loss} = 1.5 \\times 11 = 16.5\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Total loss for the day\n\nNow, let's add up the **losses**:\n\n- First race: **lost** $5\n- Second race: **won** $11 (so this is a **gain**, not a loss)\n- Third race: **lost** $16.5\n\nSo, total **loss** = $5 (first race) + $16.5 (third race) = **$21.5**\n\n---\n\n### Step 5: Average loss per race\n\nThere were **3 races**, so the **average loss per race** is:\n\n$$\n\\text{Average loss} = \\frac{\\text{Total loss}}{\\text{Number of races}} = \\frac{21.5}{3} \\approx 7.17\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{7.17}\n$$\n\nSo, Johnny's dad lost an **average of $7.17 per race** that day.", "decode_seconds": 10.52681040391326, "draft_calls": 190, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 103, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "feab69e578bc680789cbc2732d079c21f6270a41a60fa7a519ef75fe16572582", "method": "relay_reduced", "output_hash": "585fea01c70e97d7b35c7012c2d7c5e3e23d453aaf1092aa1b3cfacc90cfb45a", "output_tokens": 436, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 19885287424, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20103299072, "problem_id": "gsm8k/b7f59158b17ad0c2", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 4394.787803053856, "prefill_full_target": 32.69811248779297, "prefill_relay": 0.19439999759197235, "relay": 30.691040068864822, "unattributed_runtime": 161.4816718250513, "verification_full_target": 5906.9573764801025}, "proposal_lengths": [7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 